<title>USA: Oak Industries sets $50 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Oak Industries sets $50 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oak Industries Inc said on Thursday its board authorized the repurchase of up to $50 million of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Oak said it expected to hold the repurchased stock as treasury stock, to meet the company's obligations under its stock plans and for other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made from time to time on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions, it said.</p>
<p>Oak said it would fund purchases under its existing credit facilities. Oak supplies components to manufacturers and service providers in the communications industry.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
